    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_f3aac175",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: master_chef_with_low_rating_meme; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The meme uses a historical photograph of Adolf Hitler, a figure associated with genocide and extreme hatred, and juxtaposes it with the text 'master chef with low rating' and 'master chef with high rating'. This is a hateful and offensive act that equates a mass murderer with a culinary professional, using his image to mock or degrade the concept of 'master chef' ratings. The intent is to provoke shock, ridicule, or contempt by associating a universally reviled historical figure with a modern, seemingly innocuous context. This is a direct attack on the dignity of the historical figure and potentially on the audience's perception of culinary arts, using the image of Hitler to imply that even a 'master chef' can be 'low rated' — a twisted and dangerous analogy that normalizes or trivializes his atrocities. The meme is designed to elicit a reaction through shock value and historical distortion, making it hateful in nature.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_7d83dd1a"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
