      "instance_name": "master_chef_rating_comparison",
      "label": "master chef rating comparison scene",
      "description": "A scene depicting a historical photograph of Adolf Hitler with text overlays that mockingly compare him to a 'master chef' with low and high ratings. The image uses his stern expression and formal attire to create a jarring juxtaposition with the culinary context. The text is positioned above and below his face, framing him as the subject of the comparison.",
