      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "Adolf Hitler is mapped as a 'master chef with low rating'",
      "description": "The top text overlay 'master chef with low rating' is spatially positioned above Adolf Hitler's face, creating an analogical mapping where the visual entity (Adolf Hitler) is being equated with or projected as the textual entity ('master chef with low rating'). This mapping is part of the meme's hateful intent to trivialize Hitler's historical atrocities by associating him with a culinary rating system.",
