      "description": "The meme equates Adolf Hitler, a mass murderer and Holocaust perpetrator, with a 'master chef' rating system, trivializing his atrocities and using his image to mock or degrade the concept of culinary excellence. This is a direct attack on the dignity of a universally reviled historical figure and constitutes hateful content.",
